R-TF8 R-TF4 R-EC19 (slice 231, Design Q607): `tln tool update talon` reads `config.toml` with no stop. The file has `default-roc = "svn-1a2b3c4"` (line 1), a value that every other command refuses with exit 19 and the hint. Here it is a warning on stderr (the text is a proposal, TW24: `<path>:<line>: <key>: <why> (ignored)`), the key is unset, and the update goes on as `tool/ts1-update` run 1: v0.3.4, exit 0. The home is the home of ts1-update plus the bad `config.toml`.
